    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51260" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vōcĭfĕro</span></b> ,
			āre, 1, v. a., rare collat. form
		of vociferor: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crescere turba et vociferare ex omnibus locis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					7, 12, 14</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 10, 28, 12</span></i>, s. v. vociferor: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui vociferant saepe,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 9, 5</span></i>
			.—<i>Pass. impers.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vociferatum ferociter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					24, 21, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
